<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/>
<pb n="107" facs="#f0126"/>
<div n="1"><head>100.</head><lb/>
<p><hi rendition="#in">D</hi>er poeti&#x017F;che Himmel Britanniens hat<lb/>
mich er&#x017F;chreckt. Wo &#x017F;ind un&#x017F;re <hi rendition="#g">Shake</hi>-<lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">&#x017F;peare</hi>, un&#x017F;re <hi rendition="#g">Swifts</hi>, <hi rendition="#g">Addi&#x017F;ons</hi>,<lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">Fieldings</hi>, <hi rendition="#g">Sterne</hi>? Wo i&#x017F;t jene Menge<lb/>
